  "description": "Composes the AI tools a host offers and runs them: a registry over however many sources, filters and validators the host registers, and an executor that opens a scope, builds the invocation context and invokes the tool inside it. A tool is a Microsoft.Extensions.AI AIFunction, so the same declaration serves an in-process agent loop and a remote protocol such as MCP. Knows nothing about ASP.NET Core, MCP or gRPC.",
